{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56388","headline":"乌石山 · 陶令君","name":"乌石山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岩壑六七崦，茅茨三两家。\n整巢归燕子，刺水长蒲芽。\n贯碧流春涨，埋红落野花。\n困随木上坐。\n脚力未须嗟。\n（见民国十七年余绍纂《龙游县志》卷三十七）（《龙游县志》附按：「右诗录自两旧志。\n案原注云：『唐人。\n』今考羣书，均未知其爲何人。\n岂令君二字，称其官耶？\n明季清初人着书，恒不喜注明出处，以致後人失考类如是，可慨也。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶令君","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}